  "description": "Document 113 event contract for the events app/modules/equipment/em_commands.py actually emits. 6 of the catalogue's 8 declared Document 41 events are implemented: EMTaskScheduled, EMSampleCollected, EMResultRecorded, EMAlertTriggered, EMActionLimitExceeded, EMExcursionClosed (EMResultRecorded/EMAlertTriggered/EMActionLimitExceeded are mutually exclusive outcomes of the same result-recording call site, chosen by `alert_action_status`). EMDataGapDetected and EMAreaHeld are declared in 07_EVENT_CATALOGUE.yaml but have no producing code path -- missed-sample/data-gap detection (a scheduled/background check) and a distinct area-hold transition (the module records the excursion itself but does not yet emit a separate area-held event) are not yet built. Verified directly against source, not assumed.",
